    {
      "id": "2026-11-01-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "anime",
      "title_zh": "图书馆里的笑",
      "title_en": "Laughing in the library",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["白天", "，", "我", "常常", "去", "图书馆", "。", "那里", "有", "很", "多", "日本", "的", "书", "，", "也", "有", "《", "千与千寻", "》", "的", "书", "。"],
        ["今天", "，", "我", "看", "了", "两", "个", "小时", "，", "笑", "了", "很", "多", "次", "。"],
        ["我", "旁边", "的", "女生", "问", "我", "：", "“", "你", "在", "看", "什么", "？", "你", "笑", "了", "很", "多", "次", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "对不起", "！", "这", "本", "书", "太", "好", "了", "。", "”"],
        ["她", "笑", "着", "说", "：", "“", "我", "开玩笑", "的", "。", "我", "也", "喜欢", "这", "本", "书", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "In the daytime I often go to the library. There are lots of Japanese books there, including the Spirited Away book.",
        "Today I read for two hours and laughed lots of times.",
        "The girl next to me asked: “What are you reading? You’ve laughed so many times!”",
        "I said: “Sorry! This book is just too good.”",
        "She smiled and said: “I’m only joking. I like this book too!”"
      ],
      "names": ["日本", "千与千寻"],
      "new_words": ["白天", "图书馆", "开玩笑"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "白天", "english": "daytime" },
        { "word": "图书馆", "english": "library" },
        { "word": "开玩笑", "english": "to joke" },
        { "word": "日本", "english": "Japan" },
        { "word": "千与千寻", "english": "Spirited Away (Studio Ghibli film)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-01-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "archive fashion",
      "title_zh": "哪些衣服？",
      "title_en": "Which clothes?",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "很", "爱", "买", "衣服", "。", "我", "的", "衣服", "太", "多", "了", "，", "房间", "里", "都", "放", "不", "下", "了", "。"],
        ["我", "姐", "说", "：", "“", "你", "要", "送", "一些", "给", "别人", "。", "”"],
        ["我", "想", "了", "一会儿", "：", "哪些", "要", "？", "哪些", "不", "要", "？"],
        ["最后", "，", "老", "衣服", "我", "都", "要", "，", "新", "衣服", "我", "送", "给", "别人", "。", "我", "姐", "也", "拿", "了", "两", "个", "包", "。"],
        ["我", "姐", "笑", "了", "：", "“", "你", "真", "喜欢", "老", "东西", "！", "”", "我", "也", "笑", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I love buying clothes. I've got too many — they don't fit in my room any more.",
        "My older sister said: “You should give some away.”",
        "I thought for a while: which ones do I keep? Which ones go?",
        "In the end I kept all the old clothes and gave the new ones away. My sister took two bags too.",
        "My sister laughed: “You really do love old things!” I laughed too."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["姐", "哪些"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "姐", "english": "older sister" },
        { "word": "哪些", "english": "which ones" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "missions": [
    {
      "id": "2026-11-01-m1",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "At the library desk",
      "role": "工作人员",
      "goal": "Ask when the library closes, find out how to borrow books and get a library card.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "请问", "english": "excuse me, may I ask…" },
        { "word": "图书馆", "english": "library" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "你好，有什么事？",
          "partner_en": "Hello, can I help?",
          "prompt_en": "Ask what time the library closes.",
          "answers_zh": ["请问，图书馆几点关门？", "请问几点关门？"],
          "answers_en": ["Excuse me, what time does the library close?", "Excuse me, what time do you close?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "晚上九点。",
          "partner_en": "Nine in the evening.",
          "prompt_en": "Ask if you can borrow books.",
          "answers_zh": ["我可以借书吗？", "能借书吗？"],
          "answers_en": ["Can I borrow books?", "Is it possible to borrow books?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "可以，你有借书卡吗？",
          "partner_en": "Yes — do you have a library card?",
          "prompt_en": "Say no, and ask where to get one.",
          "answers_zh": ["没有，在哪儿办？", "没有，怎么办？"],
          "answers_en": ["No — where do I get one?", "No, what should I do?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "在这儿办就行，给我看一下你的护照。",
          "partner_en": "You can get one right here — let me see your passport.",
          "prompt_en": "Say here you are.",
          "answers_zh": ["好的，给你。", "在这儿。"],
          "answers_en": ["Sure, here you are.", "Here it is."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "好了！一次可以借五本。",
          "partner_en": "Done! You can borrow five books at a time.",
          "prompt_en": "Say great, thank you.",
          "answers_zh": ["太好了，谢谢！", "好的，谢谢你！"],
          "answers_en": ["Great, thanks!", "OK, thank you!"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "不客气。",
      "closing_en": "You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-01-m2",
